      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Just like the present active participle (ὤν οὖσα ὄν, etc.), παύσας παύσασα παῦσαν (παυσαvτ-) follows a ‘3-1-3’ pattern, i.e. the m. and n. forms follow the pattern of type 3a and 3b nouns and the f. follows that of a type 1c noun like θάλασσα. See 87.",
